  "text": "The magic of your patron ensures you always have certain spells ready; when you reach a Warlock level specified in the Fiend Spells table, you thereafter always have the listed spells prepared.\n\n##### Fiend Spells\n\n| **Warlock Level** | **Spells** |\n| 3 | *Burning Hands*, *Command*, *Scorching Ray*, *Suggestion* |\n| 5 | *Fireball*, *Stinking Cloud* |\n| 7 | *Fire Shield*, *Wall of Fire* |\n| 9 | *Geas*, *Insect Plague* |",
